.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail\" alt=\"SIPS procedure is based on duodenal switch\" title=\"Duodenal-Switch\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-90x90.jpg.webp 90w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-144x144.jpg.webp 144w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/08/Duodenal-Switch-50x50.jpg.webp 50w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h2 style=\"text-align: left;font-family:Montserrat;font-weight:400;font-style:normal\" class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading\">Duodenal Switch/SIPS Procedure</h2>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>The duodenal switch or SIPS Procedure is the most powerful of all weight loss surgeries! &nbsp;However, SIPS/DS patients are also at the highest risk for vitamin and nutrient deficiences and MUST be compliant with the recommended post-op vitamins. &nbsp;We recommend&nbsp;checking the following labs afterwards:</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline vc_do_btn\"><a class=\"vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-rounded vc_btn3-style-flat vc_btn3-color-juicy-pink\" href=\"https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-duodenal-switchsips/\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\">Read more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_tta-panel\" id=\"1441873920568-18a8a48a-7614\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\"><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-heading\"><h4 class=\"vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left\"><a href=\"#1441873920568-18a8a48a-7614\" data-vc-accordion=\"\" data-vc-container=\".vc_tta-container\"><span class=\"vc_tta-title-text\">Restrictive Procedures-Lap Band/Gastric Sleeve</span><i class=\"vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus\"></i></a></h4></div><div class=\"vc_tta-panel-body\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_rounded  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-150x150.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail\" alt=\"gastric band\" title=\"gastric_banding\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-90x90.jpg.webp 90w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-144x144.jpg.webp 144w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/gastric_banding-50x50.jpg.webp 50w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h2 style=\"text-align: left;font-family:Montserrat;font-weight:400;font-style:normal\" class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading\">Lap Band/Realize Band</h2>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>For gastric band patients, no specific labs are needed. &nbsp;We recommend regular health screening labs according to your primary care physician’s guidelines.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_rounded  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-150x150.gif\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail\" alt=\"Vertical Sleeve Gastrectomy\" title=\"Gastric Sleeve\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-150x150.gif 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-500x500.gif 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-180x180.gif 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-90x90.gif 90w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic-300x300.gif 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h2 style=\"text-align: left;font-family:Montserrat;font-weight:400;font-style:normal\" class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading\"><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-gastric-sleeve/\">Gastric Sleeve</a></h2>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>Even though the gastric sleeve is not technically a malabsorptive procedure, vitamin deficiencies can rarely arise. &nbsp;For this reason we recommend the following following labs aftwards:</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline vc_do_btn\"><a class=\"vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-rounded vc_btn3-style-flat vc_btn3-color-juicy-pink\" href=\"https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-gastric-sleeve/\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\">Read more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
  "bodyMarkdown": "#### (#1441873920660-a173daba-0456)\n\n## Gastric Bypass/RNY\n\nGastric bypass is a malabsorptive operation, which can lead to vitamin and nutrient deficiencies, especially if not properly monitored.  Therefore, we recommend bloodwork every 6-12 months afterwards:\n\n(https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-gastric-bypass/)\n\n## Duodenal Switch/SIPS Procedure\n\nThe duodenal switch or SIPS Procedure is the most powerful of all weight loss surgeries!  However, SIPS/DS patients are also at the highest risk for vitamin and nutrient deficiences and MUST be compliant with the recommended post-op vitamins.  We recommend checking the following labs afterwards:\n\n(https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-duodenal-switchsips/)\n\n#### (#1441873920568-18a8a48a-7614)\n\n## Lap Band/Realize Band\n\nFor gastric band patients, no specific labs are needed.  We recommend regular health screening labs according to your primary care physician’s guidelines.\n\n## (https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-gastric-sleeve/)\n\nEven though the gastric sleeve is not technically a malabsorptive procedure, vitamin deficiencies can rarely arise.  For this reason we recommend the following following labs aftwards:\n\n(https://journeylite.com/bloodwork-gastric-sleeve/)",
